#ShakeRadius    80.0  #(falls off slowly, so at 18.0 feet from center, only a mild shake)


Shake          0.08     #How much to shake the camera when event with this bhvr is created
ShakeFallOff   .001    #how long shake lasts
ShakeRadius    30.0  #(falls off slowly, so at 18.0 feet from center, only a mild shake)



End


